# Batch files are committed WITH CRLF bytes and marked -text so git never
# converts them: cmd.exe mis-parses goto/labels in LF-only .bat files (the
# "double-click does nothing" failure), and this must hold for git clones on
# any OS and for GitHub ZIP downloads alike.
*.bat -text
# Shell scripts must stay LF or bash rejects them when a Windows checkout
# (core.autocrlf=true) would otherwise stamp CRLF into them.
*.sh  text eol=lf
